This package is a clean-room replacement for the Collate Community License
ingestion framework. It does not include, copy, transpile, or depend on
`ingestion/`, `openmetadata-ingestion`, or `openmetadata-airflow-apis`.
It talks to the Apache `openmetadata-service` REST API using documented
paths only.
